graph TD
    UserPool["Cognito User Pool <br> (amazon-nona-robotics-app-user-pool)"]
    UserPoolClient["Cognito User Pool Client <br> (No Client Secret, SRP Enabled)"]
    IdentityPool["Cognito Identity Pool <br> (AmazonNovaRoboticsIdentityPool)"]
    AuthRole["Authenticated IAM Role <br> (CognitoDefaultAuthenticatedRole)"]
    RolePolicy["CfnRolePolicy <br> (CognitoIdentityPoolPolicy)"]
    RoleAttachment["CfnIdentityPoolRoleAttachment"]

    UserPoolClient -->|binds to| UserPool
    IdentityPool -->|binds UserPool & Client| UserPoolClient
    IdentityPool -->|federates| UserPool
    RoleAttachment -->|attaches to| IdentityPool
    RoleAttachment -->|assigns active role| AuthRole
    AuthRole -->|attaches permission policies| RolePolicy

    class UserPool,UserPoolClient,IdentityPool,AuthRole,RolePolicy,RoleAttachment Security;

    classDef Security fill:#7B2CBF,stroke:#5A189A,stroke-width:2px,color:#FFFFFF;
